fad29e5b119e68d62085c6f7ca541a\nauthor Derek <derekgranito@gmail.com> 1781726545 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781726545 -0400\n\ndocs(secrets): node owns its namespace (no per-key catalog gate); only substrate keys reserved (#32)","verified_at":"2026-06-17T20:02:26Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d","node_id":"C_kwDOS9rTN9oAKGRiZTBjZDkyMGMwYTRkMmY1ZjYxZmNlMjEyNjhlZTMwY2QzMmFlOGQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/commits/dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/commit/dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d","author":{"name":"Derek","email":"derekgranito@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-17T21:57:41Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-17T21:57:41Z"},"tree":{"sha":"f90eb888a32b02989f5164440f13f97da0170478","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/trees/f90eb888a32b02989f5164440f13f97da0170478"},"message":"docs(skill): rewrite test-expert for the single-node fork (it was a verbatim operator copy) (#31)\n\nnode-template's test-expert was a near-verbatim copy of the operator monorepo's:\n'in this monorepo', nodes/<node>/app paths, pnpm -F <node>, multi-node stack/\nisolation, the cogni-operator-test app, DoltHub test orgs, the env-e2e node-\nformation lane, poly/resy examples — almost none of which exist in a flat single-\nnode fork. It described a dozen commands the fork doesn't have (test:meta,\ntest:contract, test:arch, test:stack, check:fast, arch:check, check:docs). A node\nauthor following it was actively misled.\n\nRewritten against this node's REAL surface (verified, not assumed):\n- CI = exactly static / unit / component; stack/external/money are local-only.\n- Real scripts only: pnpm test, test:component, test:external, test:external:money,\n  check, db:check, typecheck. No invented commands.\n- Flat app/ paths; pnpm --filter @cogni/node-template-app, not -F <node>.\n- Drops operator-only scaffolding: env-e2e/node-formation, multi-node, cogni-\n  operator-test, DoltHub orgs, poly/resy, coverage-dial, tests/lint, e2e/Playwright.\n- Keeps the universal value: layer-picking, never-mock-the-DB, the dotenv-CWD trap,\n  skip-gate ordering, component-as-RLS-gate (links schema-update).\n\nThis is the source fix; it propagates to forks via the same path as the other\nskills (manual until the fork-sync webhook lands, bug.5036). Closes the last\nknown toothless skill in the node-template audit.","parents":[{"sha":"55b0c712097ac201b1530f72c2e1090f1bc8bf0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/commits/55b0c712097ac201b1530f72c2e1090f1bc8bf0c","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/commit/55b0c712097ac201b1530f72c2e1090f1bc8bf0c"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMxhVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAokoQAIdwKSgnT8PEknvJ2DRrS/i1\nltt/1MDTYnCOineKWOtbCEykgiZsOeXbnPmfDQPqL79F6Mjz7Rc3BXQBRjysr564\nSrDzEwqJIcZ4WEL3Ti8Y6+/ke/oOP5xlLbCiyxkYKNXwb+bJGcbEGcXn2siQQg+J\nbjru1bWVKDbBaMw/vchhBvnc+/3zuoYcYh/4OVQvXnQs78so2JwFEomjSjYGkddQ\ns1JvaRPbpgv8d5thXKRR82Cv14/Nmc0oGn/JAQEbHOLSqihquqiPKJIXTR9V4qd3\n1hHkYF9v+5LSv71wRFrLI8ETE50Cv/F0pW/ca0mhvtuKM0pIDbRl5bWoQhOSa/Tj\nOE31dEH1Xnv2BF9Dw42bO1dq/k9WQzzxUPPk4dqU8R1/KkUkYlu5LFPC9iAb2XZY\nG4N4LbWzfYzV0WfbqVTAMFXmPJe/pfummIxZeB9fZbyDa9mG/QH5hUMxcLGlS7Xu\nm30tUPWeQT32Ffw/DAKUe17OnX8JqrgcTvJNSu/Zb7aFfrLXWj5OWyiAcm1t4ecb\n/UK9MMapQGkwmaFuS06H8XpTtmc3y0yeZCcd1SSWoaRPOeMs0RvR+xmWAJuxUKu4\n/8I0MZK3HLl+qrILhddQyCSzSBbgw2CqV1KYke1CGYLSATXIZtCZX/PROKv2s1BX\nlDI9j7VNBoKcePFshHg8\n=LeFC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree f90eb888a32b02989f5164440f13f97da0170478\nparent 55b0c712097ac201b1530f72c2e1090f1bc8bf0c\nauthor Derek <derekgranito@gmail.com> 1781733461 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781733461 -0400\n\ndocs(skill): rewrite test-expert for the single-node fork (it was a verbatim operator copy) (#31)\n\nnode-template's test-expert was a near-verbatim copy of the operator monorepo's:\n'in this monorepo', nodes/<node>/app paths, pnpm -F <node>, multi-node stack/\nisolation, the cogni-operator-test app, DoltHub test orgs, the env-e2e node-\nformation lane, poly/resy examples — almost none of which exist in a flat single-\nnode fork. It described a dozen commands the fork doesn't have (test:meta,\ntest:contract, test:arch, test:stack, check:fast, arch:check, check:docs). A node\nauthor following it was actively misled.\n\nRewritten against this node's REAL surface (verified, not assumed):\n- CI = exactly static / unit / component; stack/external/money are local-only.\n- Real scripts only: pnpm test, test:component, test:external, test:external:money,\n  check, db:check, typecheck. No invented commands.\n- Flat app/ paths; pnpm --filter @cogni/node-template-app, not -F <node>.\n- Drops operator-only scaffolding: env-e2e/node-formation, multi-node, cogni-\n  operator-test, DoltHub orgs, poly/resy, coverage-dial, tests/lint, e2e/Playwright.\n- Keeps the universal value: layer-picking, never-mock-the-DB, the dotenv-CWD trap,\n  skip-gate ordering, component-as-RLS-gate (links schema-update).\n\nThis is the source fix; it propagates to forks via the same path as the other\nskills (manual until the fork-sync webhook lands, bug.5036). Closes the last\nknown toothless skill in the node-template audit.","verified_at":"2026-06-17T21:57:41Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"0ca9f9b68f35a447c8065c0227127c65ddbf32d6","node_id":"C_kwDOS9rTN9oAKDBjYTlmOWI2OGYzNWE0NDdjODA2NWMwMjI3MTI3YzY1ZGRiZjMyZDY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/commits/0ca9f9b68f35a447c8065c0227127c65ddbf32d6","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/commit/0ca9f9b68f35a447c8065c0227127c65ddbf32d6","author":{"name":"Derek","email":"derekgranito@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-17T23:21:56Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-17T23:21:56Z"},"tree":{"sha":"b11176857d51fdbe5a72a1bfe4a4db501128350a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/trees/b11176857d51fdbe5a72a1bfe4a4db501128350a"},"message":"feat(knowledge): adopt DELETE_IS_CLEAN — delete op, not soft-deprecate (#38)\n\nPort of Cogni-DAO/cogni#1730. Replaces the contribution `deprecate` op (which\nset status='deprecated' — write-only cruft nothing reads) with a `delete` op:\nDAG-safe (409 if still cited; cascades own outbound edges), hard-deletes the row.\nDolt history preserves content + commits + attribution. Keeps node-template in\nlockstep with the operator standard (no node should set the 'deprecated' standard).","parents":[{"sha":"dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/commits/dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/commit/dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMywUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnBkQAFwUAXkiiXAFtAHGCHooYcKq\nuIl2XxDZFcl5xuG/E9vjSH6oTLJgiQfC0Cc5T/FuYpQ4TIZXh9wH1WLlbhlcp1Pw\nACbgIV5FXrv3cG2tAmLhdPMmapyRHzB8XWyc39uHvEBmAu4lRhqHvRfuURRzb62k\nWefGhuVdPy9I2H3k8whkMFNTf6e0Wah9xLXfUiDWMhOpgbbH1EPlb3f6zxOkSNY5\nMgxg4Ot9OknqnsIXQsYKb7d52QwvZ6OhUaIj3JDG9AcxmqEWbmi0DUnQKRf9jafR\nk1tVzB+JajTuVEb7uk9AJJ36yn3NadQQbyk7zpqR8U6NlsaeEb1IBcCV3IG5UKKL\nylFsh1M2rLuNu0nNZJJeqfs4Q5MEtRnapUA4SsLg6QMWfE6u/v6KXyEIXJZ4w9s6\nreFnm7/OIu1xKgWXcEKwA55wTUkuKgZBhdr7uCyMDn6c2A2ctTJzvEoXo3XvcG0G\nAjr1rU7ykOHBxk+pKfhOnM4fTMJkTZwCq0NTQ9E9aC1qyjxeCpkYio0+xwGzEDt0\not+umNrxPO/V4OJMjjed9Qnct+FslvutJ8upbreimIzdh8CqDyOmgDfOGZrTdaIv\nD3+jh3dCuep7W+oiUTsITTO5fVQHqspa9aV7+kIiky/FX7FweCtb+6veb7ehKwu4\ncc41tfbNbmrwdsDKpz9H\n=I0L3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b11176857d51fdbe5a72a1bfe4a4db501128350a\nparent dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d\nauthor Derek <derekgranito@gmail.com> 1781738516 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781738516 -0400\n\nfeat(knowledge): adopt DELETE_IS_CLEAN — delete op, not soft-deprecate (#38)\n\nPort of Cogni-DAO/cogni#1730. Replaces the contribution `deprecate` op (which\nset status='deprecated' — write-only cruft nothing reads) with a `delete` op:\nDAG-safe (409 if still cited; cascades own outbound edges), hard-deletes the row.\nDolt history preserves content + commits + attribution. Keeps node-template in\nlockstep with the operator standard (no node should set the 'deprecated' standard).","verified_at":"2026-06-17T23:21:57Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"4d838666cb8e7baf9c5beb46b195b7ec727fa986","node_id":"C_kwDOS9rTN9oAKDRkODM4NjY2Y2I4ZTdiYWY5YzViZWI0NmIxOTViN2VjNzI3ZmE5ODY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/commits/4d838666cb8e7baf9c5beb46b195b7ec727fa986","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/commit/4d838666cb8e7baf9c5beb46b195b7ec727fa986","author":{"name":"Derek","email":"derekgranito@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-18T05:48:43Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-18T05:48:43Z"},"tree":{"sha":"20a4c7a0ff39c43e461e064c8399d24247fe2dcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/trees/20a4c7a0ff39c43e461e064c8399d24247fe2dcb"},"message":"fix(conductor): derive auth root from git, not a personal cogni-template path (#40)\n\nAUTH_ROOT hardcoded $HOME/dev/cogni-template as its final fallback, so on any\nnode other than the operator apex the setup script symlinked the wrong checkout's\n.env.cogni (wrong creds + var names) over the node's own and aborted with\n'exists and is not a symlink'.\n\nDerive the canonical (main) workspace from git — a Conductor spawn is a worktree\nof it — so there is zero hardcoded or personal path and never a reach into an\nunrelated repo. Keep a pre-existing real .env.cogni instead of clobbering it, and\nguard the link/refresh helpers against an empty or self-referential root.","parents":[{"sha":"0ca9f9b68f35a447c8065c0227127c65ddbf32d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/commits/0ca9f9b68f35a447c8065c0227127c65ddbf32d6","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/commit/0ca9f9b68f35a447c8065c0227127c65ddbf32d6"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqM4a7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqf0QAIiccYQzst0OhkpxyepkY2Sd\ncIerizYqKYkz6jfalVBsQkh7VJ/SQgAmQBZhCVxeiveSJu/Dd10U6bg2fOK4LLWJ\nDjkyxrACqa4e3qKK7wlGeZYu/IcVmGxPIBaIkkteLVtXJqF4XTOjc9h1eSk/Udkl\nUfYr6+C0cGln32ADnghoDi1zj9dK4V5tNRA1KWehc6yh734A2zLAX3vsVA/z2D0T\nUBB5CHH5097UFhOEsNRERIJkLa/rRmzFIR1IH9Nzy5nhZH8ZKMqfbcEmofsb8jQb\n3TniAi+9YOb7zcEVnmnMrKY1Jee/YQHNPlUJ8MzPgAGfuPkRKIZ806J9rGkO90Vv\nT9Y2JiFgaTwHPv7CXSIFzOWoX+aj5zTTSrNYMDPfRoOKmexqFaXZjNLwEDk8JVIf\nlyF6rdIS9hhE7L0G5P/A6oft/gyDOUHYecEXCoxxTH2EuGmUibs+4jQHMgC7t9Af\n0NOmeskBbdwXQF0sjfsmbtIVDV6xxpZPSFhnw9DhHoLkD+hIcoqUM7DUriXNocqp\n69xM6uHUb3ziKZzZnF9XQHCuc1+4N2VSR04RHmiUb7XZtdE89wgiDO2w+rzukGfi\naTu0tz8r6ALdKqe9h8GNowiqsqeX6y1nvyn1JBYA/HEqqsvT5lMjg9pZ6rtHMt8+\nvPDevKV+R+7yoUb7NbpU\n=eSss\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 20a4c7a0ff39c43e461e064c8399d24247fe2dcb\nparent 0ca9f9b68f35a447c8065c0227127c65ddbf32d6\nauthor Derek <derekgranito@gmail.com> 1781761723 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781761723 -0400\n\nfix(conductor): derive auth root from git, not a personal cogni-template path (#40)\n\nAUTH_ROOT hardcoded $HOME/dev/cogni-template as its final fallback, so on any\nnode other than the operator apex the setup script symlinked the wrong checkout's\n.env.cogni (wrong creds + var names) over the node's own and aborted with\n'exists and is not a symlink'.\n\nDerive the canonical (main) workspace from git — a Conductor spawn is a worktree\nof it — so there is zero hardcoded or personal path and never a reach into an\nunrelated repo. Keep a pre-existing real .env.cogni instead of clobbering it, and\nguard the link/refresh helpers against an empty or self-referential root.","verified_at":"2026-06-18T05:48:43Z"},"event":"committed"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/r